{
  "name": "04 - Shopify Order Alerts and VIP Tagging",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 - Shopify order alerts\nNew order -> Telegram message to the owner, row in Google Sheets, and orders **above the VIP threshold** get a `VIP` tag in Shopify automatically.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Shopify: create a custom app (Settings > Apps > Develop apps), scopes `read_orders` + `write_orders`, copy the Admin API access token.\n2. Credentials: *Shopify Access Token* (shop subdomain + token), *Telegram* (BotFather token), *Google Sheets OAuth2*, and a *Header Auth* credential for the tag call (header `X-Shopify-Access-Token`, value = same token).\n3. Get your chat ID: message your bot, then open `https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates`.\n4. Fill **Config**: `shopDomain` (yourstore.myshopify.com), `telegramChatId`, `sheetId`, `vipThreshold`.\n5. Sheet header row: Order, Date, Customer, Email, Items, Total, Currency, Country, Discount codes, VIP, Order ID.\n6. Activate (the trigger registers its webhook in Shopify on activation), place a test order.",
        "height": 490,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "70d11d4a-ca3a-5bee-9a0a-047edbb3be38",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        -480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "topic": "orders/create",
        "authentication": "accessToken"
      },
      "id": "6b572ac4-18b3-5f24-9a6a-204293ca00ab",
      "name": "Shopify Trigger (orders/create)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.shopifyTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "shopifyAccessTokenApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Shopify Access Token account"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "9f6ee2c9-fea4-5175-a8bc-ed4c3c6073bd"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "fabd194a-95df-578f-821d-a33dbe78e21a",
              "name": "shopDomain",
              "value": "YOUR-STORE.myshopify.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bc370a76-0ee1-5d49-8e01-aac8597b1035",
              "name": "apiVersion",
              "value": "2026-04",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3b776711-ce8b-5fb4-ba7f-e13e42af181e",
              "name": "vipThreshold",
              "value": 200,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "663f816c-3bb6-598b-b5a2-51a29a7ff4c9",
              "name": "vipTag",
              "value": "VIP",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "80217a15-6eba-510c-8bc0-813a9dc11e07",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "38105c42-1f3c-5a23-ad3f-67f1f6c48b3d",
              "name": "sheetId",
              "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b93177a4-2be4-5d59-b708-fc664cb44eb7",
              "name": "sheetName",
              "value": "Orders",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8c24a5d8-ac5d-5a3c-8130-6ec80f37bb9d",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        230,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "EDIT ME: every client-specific setting lives in this node. vipThreshold is in your shop currency.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $json;\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst total = Number(o.total_price || 0);\nconst cust = o.customer || {};\nconst ship = o.shipping_address || {};\nconst name = [cust.first_name, cust.last_name].filter(Boolean).join(' ') || ship.name || 'Guest';\nconst items = (o.line_items || []).map((i) => i.quantity + ' x ' + i.title);\nconst codes = (o.discount_codes || []).map((d) => d.code).join(', ');\nconst isVip = total > Number(cfg.vipThreshold);\nconst tags = String(o.tags || '').split(',').map((s) => s.trim()).filter(Boolean);\nif (isVip && !tags.includes(cfg.vipTag)) tags.push(cfg.vipTag);\nconst esc = (s) => String(s === undefined || s === null ? '' : s).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst adminUrl = 'https://' + cfg.shopDomain + '/admin/orders/' + o.id;\nconst telegramText = '<b>New order ' + esc(o.name) + '</b>' + (isVip ? '  [VIP]' : '') + '\\n' +\n  'Total: <b>' + esc(o.currency) + ' ' + total.toFixed(2) + '</b>\\n' +\n  'Customer: ' + esc(name) + (o.email ? ' (' + esc(o.email) + ')' : '') + '\\n' +\n  'Items: ' + esc(items.join('; ')) + '\\n' +\n  (ship.city || ship.country ? 'Ship to: ' + esc([ship.city, ship.country].filter(Boolean).join(', ')) + '\\n' : '') +\n  (codes ? 'Discount: ' + esc(codes) + '\\n' : '') +\n  '<a href=\"' + adminUrl + '\">Open in Shopify</a>';\nreturn { json: {\n  orderId: o.id,\n  orderName: o.name,\n  createdAt: o.created_at,\n  customerName: name,\n  email: o.email || cust.email || '',\n  items: items.join('; '),\n  total,\n  currency: o.currency,\n  country: ship.country || '',\n  discountCodes: codes,\n  isVip,\n  tagsAfter: tags.join(', '),\n  telegramText,\n} };\n",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "6f636917-f4fb-5413-8e3a-821a3ef367d8",
      "name": "Format Order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
